---
// 顶部导航栏
---

<header>
  <nav>
    <a href="/my-blog/" class="logo">🧑‍💻 我的技术博客</a>
    <div class="links">
      <a href="/my-blog/">首页</a>
      <a href="/my-blog/about/">关于</a>
    </div>
  </nav>
</header>

<style>
  header {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-bg);
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  nav {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .logo {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .logo:hover {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .links a {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
